  "description": "Super lightweight frame, modern progressive geometry, direct power transfer, the Probe RS redefines performance! RS, 2 letters that define this bike, RS is short for Racing Sport. This bike has one purpose, to be the best in class! The heart of the Probe RS is the EU made Elite series carbon fiber frame. No stone was left unturned to achieve a crazy light frame weight of 760 grams combined with stiffness and strength in all the right places. With the progressive geometry you can ride steep terrain with ease and confidence. No matter if it goes up or down, the Probe RS has got you covered. The low weight and immediate pedal response will make you laugh out loud with every pedal stroke. You can use a dropper post on the Probe RS to make it even more versatile and adapt it to the trails you ride or the course you are racing on.",
